Z||000017||StuGood||08-13-2001||08:51 AM||||Well, I can't say anything bad about Probes, because I never owned one.  I will say, however, that they (some of the newer ones, anyway) are one of the very few non-Fiero cars that appeal to me at <B>all</B>.<P>Why?  I think they look pretty cool.  Now, if they were plastic-bodied, could handle like a Fiero, and got rid of that (sorry, people) "4-cylinder" sound, I'd probably own one today.  Oh, and make sure the window regulators and stuff worked reliably, etc.<P>Now I'll probably get myself in trouble suggesting this, but fieroburton, did you go back to the probe board and apologize?  It would probably smooth things over, and help our image, IMHO.  Sorry if you already thought of this, by the way  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">   ||||reg||1
