Z||000029||Fformula88||08-13-2001||05:34 PM||||My7... no offense takin man.  That said, I am gonna have to stick up for the Probe a little here too.  I don't think they are equatable to K cars at all.  Reliability isn't the best in the world, but certainly better than most Fords.  Performance wise, they are very similar to Fiero's in V6 form and a Probe 4-banger will spank a Fiero 4-banger (trust me, I know from experience!)  They are very competent sports coupes, with great handling afor a FWD car as their greatest attribute.<P>It still isn't as much fun as a Fiero, and I think size has a lot to do with it.  The Fiero can be tossed around, where you need to be more deliberate with the Probe.<P><BR>As for showing our maturity... I thank everyone who posted and showed their maturity.  Most of those Probe people tend to be young hot heads who live for flame wars, and nobody managed to really get one going!  Its hard on that board to keep things fairly even tempered (and you all think this board has gotten bad!  not a chance  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ||||reg||1
